{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_6_level_main_06-07_beg",
  "groupId": "main_6",
  "stageId": "main_06-07",
  "title": "只是從天而降！",
  "storyCode": "6-8",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-07_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "29045b1da68b4fe07f8594fe96224753eecb47c542be49cc6d67591379869537",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三关（前）\n9：00 A.M. 天氣/陰\n近衛局大樓天台攻防戰14小時之前\n切爾諾伯格分城“14區”廢墟上空300米處，“壞傢伙”號\n任務目標：與羅德島救援小隊合流，營救偵察小組\n人員配置：\n“壞傢伙”號及其飛行員；羅德島精英幹員-煌，及其小隊成員\n共一十四人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飛行員",
      "text": "我們已經到了，阿米婭她們就在這個位置附近！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飛行員",
      "text": "把小隊放在城外，真的好嗎？我們現在只有兩個人，你下去你只有一個人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "哎呀，讓他們阻截整合運動的追兵，順便清理下場地，比讓他們在這打仗要有意義得多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飛行員",
      "text": "行。地形不太好，我只能送你到這兒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "足夠了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飛行員",
      "text": "......至少讓我給你放條掛索下去？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "不，你什麼時候見我用過掛索？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飛行員",
      "text": "又要亂來？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "啊？怎麼了？亂來啥？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飛行員",
      "text": "每次和你出任務......你幹的那些事，我光是坐在駕駛座看著都覺得心驚肉跳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飛行員",
      "text": "雖然不知不覺中也快習慣了，可這也改變不了你次次亂來的事實啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "這說明我和我的小隊，和你是有默契的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飛行員",
      "text": "哪敢和你有什麼默契！上回你們把人家的聚落拆了，蓄水池填了，還順帶著炸掉了礦場。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飛行員",
      "text": "你腦袋裡裝著的那些胡思亂想，請通通留在地面上，別帶上我的寶貝！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "行行行，知道了知道了，“壞傢伙”號，哈？取名時候能不能用點心？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飛行員",
      "text": "你給我下去！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飛行員",
      "text": "敵人估計發現我們了。煌，就送你到這了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "可以了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飛行員",
      "text": "我在廢城出口等你們。動作快點！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飛行員",
      "text": "啊，有聯絡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "喂！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飛行員",
      "text": "......我聽得到！聲音別那麼大！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "啊，羅德島頻道的幹員，你好！我是近衛局的，已經在廢城出口處和你們的小隊會合了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "近衛局不是撤離了嗎？現在又是演什麼戲？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "我和另外那個姓陳的可不一樣！相信我，我是來幫你們的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飛行員",
      "text": "請問貴姓？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "免貴，叫代號吧，詩懷雅長官好了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飛行員",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飛行員",
      "text": "那不就是姓？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飛行員",
      "text": "煌，你來處理下，我不知道怎麼對付官員......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飛行員",
      "text": "......煌？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "我也不會啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飛行員",
      "text": "回來！別跳！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "你剛才不是叫我下去嗎？交給你了！相信你！（飛吻）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飛行員",
      "text": "飛吻個鬼啊！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "text": "呼，呼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "......她還好吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "嗯，已經沒有大礙，只是體溫還有點低。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "text": "從來......就都很低。我沒事了，讓我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "霜葉......別急。你現在的體溫，和平常比還是低了一點。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "博士，請幫我拿一下繃帶。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "好的。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜葉",
          "text": "說了，我很好。隕星的傷才更重。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "隕星",
          "text": "不要緊。怎麼說我也是個薩卡茲人，我還是更擔心你一點。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "潔西卡，雪怪小隊的動向呢？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "潔西卡",
          "text": "正，正在向我們的位置靠近！還有五百米左右！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "排障作業還沒完成嗎？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
          "text": "還要至少十五分鐘！這裡倒塌的建築，結構比較複雜，我們不敢直接進行爆破作業。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "......隕星，做好戰鬥準備。我們要再維持一會兒防線。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "隕星",
          "text": "明白。你們帶弩彈儲備了嗎？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "有的，讓後勤幹員給你......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "阿米婭在不在？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "潔西卡",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
          "text": "......呃。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "是不是有誰的通訊頻道是一直開著的？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "這可是精英幹員專用頻道，我是能從我這邊直接打開的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "潔西卡",
          "text": "這個聲音是......？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜葉",
          "text": "完了。居然派了她。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "潔西卡",
          "text": "請問......是誰？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "是啊，這是哪個幹員，怎麼這麼激情？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "她真能改善現在的局勢嗎？",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜葉",
          "text": "一個叫煌的，能把身邊所有東西全拆掉，還讓所有人都流一身汗的幹員。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "沒錯，是我！最後一個評價不太對啊。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "別......別插科打諢了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "煌，你在哪，我們需要你的支援。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "在你們頭上。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "啊？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "還有兩百米左右。就要到了！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
          "text": "射程不夠，沒法攻擊那台機器！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
          "text": "能在空中移動的機器......這也是他們的設備？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "確保他們沒法下降。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "在羅德島的援兵到達前，消滅掉這支羅德島小隊。不能讓他們合流。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "等下。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "———往後站！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "隕星",
          "text": "她又跳下來了？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜葉",
          "text": "她又跳下來了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "阿米婭，如果你想，我可以帶你一起跳一次！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "如果可以的話，我不要。你的小隊呢？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "留在城外了，一會兒就由他們來接應。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "風聲很大，把通訊器關了！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "各位......我們支援一下煌吧。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "Dr.{@nickname}，一會兒無論她說什麼。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "......都點頭就好。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
          "text": "掉下來的這是......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
          "text": "......人？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "別因為只有一個人就放鬆警惕。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "我感受到熱量。她一直在用類似加溫的法術。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "整合運動的各位，你們好。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "我不想和感染者為敵。但聽說各位傷害了我的羅德島同僚......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "而且還在追擊我的隊友。現在我要打斷各位一下。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "......多嘴多舌。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "嗨，你好，用冰的小姐。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "我想試試用我的溫度和你的溫度打一次。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
